{"reviews":[{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-0","r":1.0,"t":"MAYBE if they shipped it in a box instead of an envelope that gets tossed around it might have looked better. Every disa","x":"Returned it!!  Looked cheap, flowers smashed, MAYBE if they shipped it in a box instead of an envelope that gets tossed around it might have looked better. Every disappointed!!","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-1","r":4.0,"t":"Very cute","x":"I wish the item was better packed, came very smooshed. But pretty colors, matches the description perfectly","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-2","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect for milk bath photo shoots!","x":"Love that the head piece is adjustable and it looked so pretty on! I purchased this for a milk bath photography shoot and it was perfect!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-3","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect for a princess","x":"We needed a crown of purple flowers for a Rapunzel photo shoot. This was perfect! It photographed very well and my daughter loved it!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-4","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"Fell apart quickly. Poorly made. Rather cheese low quality material.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-5","r":3.0,"t":"Super pretty but falls apart instantly","x":"I bought this for my daughter\u2019s birthday. It was beautiful and she loved it but it was already starting to fall apart in the first use at her party. So as much as I\u2019d love to give it a great review, this company needs to find a way to affix the materials so that they don\u2019t fall off instantly.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-6","r":5.0,"t":"Adorable","x":"I used this for my daughter's birthday as her crown. She looked great in it and we got lots of compliments. It's a perfect rainbow gradient, not too bright to look totally fakey, but bright enough to see the rainbow. Each little flower is different too, which makes it look really nice.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-7","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful!","x":"Perfect for our granddaughters' photo shoot!  Excellent quality, beautiful colors, and convenient wiring to make larger for Spirit the pony!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-8","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful","x":"After looking at many different flowered pieces like this I decided to go with this one due to the fact that it wasn\u2019t tacky or cheap looking , when I receive this item I was very pleased it was packaged very nicely in perfect condition, which I was concerned from reading some of the other reviews but it  worked out . This piece is elegant,classic and very pretty  it\u2019s very delicate and the flowers look great again does not look cheap or tacky I\u2019m super satisfied with my purchase and I would hig","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-9","r":3.0,"t":"color not as advertised","x":"To be fair I didn\u2019t realize I ordered the \u201cdaisy orange\u201d until I went to return the item ... in the picture it looks more gold, like an actual yellow daisy. What I got was in fact orange. So the name/description is correct, but the image displayed is not a representation of the color you\u2019ll get if you order that particular headband.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-10","r":3.0,"t":"Not as pictured","x":"Pretty, but not as pictured. I expected the big flowers to have more yellow in them according to the advertised photo, but they are definitely orange. Had to add in my own yellow flowers.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-11","r":5.0,"t":"Good for Carole Baskin Costume","x":"Got this for a halloween costume. The tiara was the final addition my wife needed for her Carol baskin look. The tiara was exactly what we expected and went great with her costume","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-12","r":5.0,"t":"Very cute","x":"I received exactly what I ordered. Beautiful flowers fits the little flower girl perfectly. Speedy shipping can\u2019t complain all in all happy with my purchase.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-13","r":4.0,"t":"I was a little disappointed. I had to glue almost all of the ...","x":"I was a little disappointed. I had to glue almost all of the flowers back on it when I received it in the mail.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-14","r":4.0,"t":"Cute! Matched the picture.","x":"These were for a wedding - cute, decent for the price.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-15","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful","x":"Fit my 12 yr old perfectly, wouldn\u2019t fit any older.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-16","r":4.0,"t":"It\u2019s very pretty!","x":"I bought this crown wreath for my 9 month old granddaughter for a picture. It\u2019s really pretty, good quality, gorgeous colors and quality but I was unable to use it because it bothered her on her head. I recommend it but for toddlers over 2 years old that might feel more comfortable wearing a wreath. You can easily adjust the size. It\u2019s well made and the flowers are firmly attached.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-17","r":5.0,"t":"Very appropriate for a child.","x":"I bought 3 of these for tea party dress ups  with my granddaughters.  They are a good size for smaller children, and are lightweight.  They are colorful - one red, one blue, one purple, and the girls are very happy with them.  It's a complete success for the intended purpose and the price is reasonable.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-18","r":4.0,"t":"Carol baskin costume","x":"Bought this solely for Halloween costume carol baskin. It was a cheap one time use thing so I didn't mind wearing it for a short while when the price was great. However it is super uncomfortable with the metal wire they used so I would beware of that but overall great for short term use","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-19","r":2.0,"t":"These are not horrible but not great","x":"Doesn't fit on any head adult or child I really had to twist and Bobby pin this thing in and it still didn't stay put that well I'm not sure how you are supposed to wear it or what age group its meant for I bought 2 for my daughter's and they were ok just ok","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-20","r":1.0,"t":"Very Cheap","x":"Sadly, this really looked cheap.  It's almost like someone took a flower vine from a craft store, formed it into a circle and was like, \"Done!\"  Luckily, I found another one that looked so much better and was of a far superior quality.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-21","r":1.0,"t":"Not as good as picture","x":"My received item was not good. The pink color was light. Some of the flowers were in bad shape and also looked dirty. Bought it for my wife's baby shower, but now she is not going to use it in the baby shower. Very much disappointed.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-22","r":3.0,"t":"Beautiful but uncomfortable","x":"Some of the flowers had come off the petals so I had to Reggie them! The heavy wire was uncomfortable for my 5 yr old granddaughter. But she did love the appearance. I\u2019m afraid she won\u2019t wear it often because it\u2019s uncomfortable!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-23","r":1.0,"t":"It is the wrong color","x":"I ordered a color that was supposed to be yellow like what is looks like in the picture (very yellow.) Instead it looks like the option Orange .It was a part for a costume and now I will have to get a new one.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07BW9CGXX-24","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome product!","x":"Love this headband! Easy to adjust for different head sizes. I bought these for our daughters dedication and they were perfect! My girls are 2 and 7 Just fluff up the flowers when you take out of packaging.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the flower crown pretty and perfect for photo shoots, birthdays, and costumes.","cites":[3,4,7,8,12,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the flowers fall apart or arrive damaged and needing repair.","cites":[5,6,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers complain about poor packaging that leaves the item smooshed or smashed.","cites":[1,2]},{"text":"A few reviewers say the color is more orange than the advertised photo suggests.","cites":[10,11]},{"text":"Some reviewers praise the quality and value, saying it looks nice and matches the description.","cites":[2,8,9,15]}]},"qa":[]}